WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:07.371
Your Shopify store is almost right. But something is missing, and changing the theme yourself feels risky.

2
00:00:08.321 --> 00:00:15.326
Tell us what you need. A new section, a better product page, a cleaner look. We add it to the theme you already have.

3
00:00:16.277 --> 00:00:22.578
Before any work starts, you get a written quote, with a fixed price and a delivery date. No surprise bills.

4
00:00:23.528 --> 00:00:30.043
We work on a copy of your store, so your live shop keeps selling. Every change is checked on computer and phone.

5
00:00:30.993 --> 00:00:36.334
When we hand over, you can change text, colours and settings yourself. No code needed.

6
00:00:37.284 --> 00:00:40.151
And when your theme updates, your changes stay safe.

7
00:00:41.101 --> 00:00:47.189
Send us your store link, and get a fixed quote within two business days. Prices start at fifty dollars.
